  "description": "Alerts only on the problems from Umbraco's scheduled health checks, by email and an optional JSON webhook. Lists warnings and errors, counts the rest as passed, names the site and environment, goes to one or many recipients, does not repeat unchanged problems, says when they are resolved, and never sends from a developer's local run by default. Snooze known problems and change settings in a back office dashboard with no deploy. Silence means healthy.",
